              "text": "She shouted at him, telling him that he was silly and that she wished the food was stuck to his nose.",
              "audioStart": 101.013,
              "audioEnd": 106.125
            },
            {
              "text": "Right away, the second wish came true, and the long item jumped up and attached itself firmly to the man's face.",
              "audioStart": 106.987,
              "audioEnd": 113.2
            },
            {
              "text": "The couple tried to pull it off, but the object remained completely stuck.",
              "audioStart": 114.062,
              "audioEnd": 117.975
            },
            {
              "text": "They realized that they had now lost two of their three valuable wishes on a silly argument about food.",
              "audioStart": 118.838,
              "audioEnd": 124.263
            },
            {
              "text": "With only one wish left, the man had to decide what was most important for their future.",
              "audioStart": 125.125,
              "audioEnd": 129.875
            },
            {
              "text": "If they kept the item on his face forever, life would be terrible for both of them.",
              "audioStart": 130.738,
              "audioEnd": 134.838
            },
            {
              "text": "Therefore, the husband used his final wish to make the object fall back onto the table.",
              "audioStart": 135.7,
              "audioEnd": 140.35
            },
            {
              "text": "In the end, they had no extra money or gold, but they were together and safe.",
              "audioStart": 141.213,
              "audioEnd": 145.488
            },
            {
              "text": "They learned a funny and important lesson about how easily valuable things can be wasted through silly choices.",
              "audioStart": 146.35,
              "audioEnd": 152.075
            },
            {
              "text": "The man looked at his wife and smiled because they were still alive.",
              "audioStart": 152.938,
              "audioEnd": 156.175
            },
            {
              "text": "They understood that love was much more significant than any special wish.",
              "audioStart": 157.037,
              "audioEnd": 160.875
            },
            {
              "text": "From that day forward, they lived happily without any further trouble.",
              "audioStart": 161.738,
              "audioEnd": 165.275
            },
            {
              "text": "They went back to their normal work and found rest in their simple life.",
              "audioStart": 166.137,
              "audioEnd": 169.575
            },
            {
              "text": "Whenever they talked about the forest spirit, they laughed together about the strange event.",
              "audioStart": 170.438,
              "audioEnd": 174.887
            },
            {
              "text": "The little house near the woods felt warmer than ever before.",
              "audioStart": 175.75,
              "audioEnd": 178.787
            },
            {
              "text": "They never forgot the lesson that the spirit had brought to their door.",
              "audioStart": 179.65,
              "audioEnd": 182.787
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Many people wonder if stories from the past can teach modern lessons.",
              "audioStart": 183.65,
              "audioEnd": 187.363
            },
            {
              "text": "This particular tale shows how small choices may lead to strange results if people do not think carefully.",
              "audioStart": 188.225,
              "audioEnd": 193.537
            },
            {
              "text": "The husband and wife had very little money, yet they survived the difficult times through hard work.",
              "audioStart": 194.4,
              "audioEnd": 199.225
            },
            {
              "text": "Although they made a silly mistake with their first two wishes, they finally understood what mattered most.",
              "audioStart": 200.088,
              "audioEnd": 205.537
            },
            {
              "text": "They were safe together in their small home, which was worth more than gold.",
              "audioStart": 206.4,
              "audioEnd": 209.95
            },
            {
              "text": "Life continued for the couple without any more unusual events in the forest.",
              "audioStart": 210.812,
              "audioEnd": 214.812
            },
            {
              "text": "They stayed in the same village for many years and always remembered the spirit.",
              "audioStart": 215.675,
              "audioEnd": 219.537
            },
            {
              "text": "Whenever friends visited them, the husband told the story of the long item on his nose.",
              "audioStart": 220.4,
              "audioEnd": 224.863
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone laughed at the funny memory, and the couple felt happy.",
              "audioStart": 225.725,
              "audioEnd": 229.062
            },
            {
              "text": "Such lessons are rarely forgotten by people who live through hard experiences.",
              "audioStart": 229.925,
              "audioEnd": 234.025
            },
            {
              "text": "Rest and love remained in the house until the end of their days.",
              "audioStart": 234.887,
              "audioEnd": 237.912
            },
            {
              "text": "No other spirit ever appeared to them again, but they needed nothing else.",
              "audioStart": 238.775,
              "audioEnd": 242.575
            },
            {
              "text": "Their simple life was full of quiet moments and shared meals.",
              "audioStart": 243.438,
              "audioEnd": 246.662
            },
            {
              "text": "They never wished for anything else because they had each other.",
              "audioStart": 247.525,
              "audioEnd": 251.661
            },
            {
              "text": "The woods outside stayed green through every season of the year.",
              "audioStart": 252.524,
              "audioEnd": 255.549
            },
            {
              "text": "Birds sang in the trees while the wind blew softly across the land.",
              "audioStart": 256.411,
              "audioEnd": 259.724
            },
            {
              "text": "Everything was quiet again, and the world seemed right.",
              "audioStart": 260.587,
              "audioEnd": 263.524
            },
            {
              "text": "They knew that the past could not be changed by any other wish.",
              "audioStart": 264.387,
              "audioEnd": 267.611
            },
            {
              "text": "Both of them walked outside into the garden to look at the trees.",
              "audioStart": 268.474,
              "audioEnd": 271.499
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun shone down upon the ground and made everything look bright.",
              "audioStart": 272.361,
              "audioEnd": 275.649
            },
            {
              "text": "They felt that nothing could ever hurt them again.",
              "audioStart": 276.512,
              "audioEnd": 278.712
            },
            {
              "text": "Each day brought new hope to their hearts.",
              "audioStart": 279.574,
              "audioEnd": 281.587
            },
            {
              "text": "The small house was filled with joy from morning until night.",
              "audioStart": 282.449,
              "audioEnd": 285.374
            },
            {
              "text": "They shared every single meal together with great happiness.",
              "audioStart": 286.236,
              "audioEnd": 289.312
            },
            {
              "text": "The story of the wish became a treasured memory for both of them.",
              "audioStart": 290.174,
              "audioEnd": 293.199
            },
            {
              "text": "Even when times were hard, they remembered how much they loved each other.",
              "audioStart": 294.062,
              "audioEnd": 297.486
            },
            {
              "text": "The simple life was all they ever wanted.",
              "audioStart": 298.349,
              "audioEnd": 300.399
            },
            {
              "text": "They stayed together until the very end of their lives.",
              "audioStart": 301.262,
              "audioEnd": 303.937
            }
          ]
        }
